## Goal
Show how the six samples of the rnaseq_bulk assay relate to one another in gene-expression
space, and whether they separate by condition (untreated vs treated). The deliverable is a
principal component analysis of the gene-level count matrix, with samples plotted on the
leading components and coloured by condition.

